*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%  LAMAX InstaKid2 Plus - thermal printing over BLE (cat-printer protocol).
*%  Filter: rastertoinstakid, backend: instakid (instakid://BQ95B).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "instakid2.ppd"
*Manufacturer: "LAMAX"
*Product: "(InstaKid2 Plus)"
*ModelName: "InstaKid2 Plus"
*ShortNickName: "LAMAX InstaKid2 Plus"
*NickName: "LAMAX InstaKid2 Plus (BLE thermal, 384 px)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 rastertoinstakid"

*% ---- Paper size (width fixed at 48 mm = 136 pt; length depends on the roll) ----
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: 48x50mm
*PageSize 48x30mm/48 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[136 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 48x50mm/48 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[136 142]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 48x75mm/48 x 75 mm: "<</PageSize[136 213]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 48x100mm/48 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 48x150mm/48 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[136 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: 48x50mm
*PageRegion 48x30mm/48 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[136 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 48x50mm/48 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[136 142]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 48x75mm/48 x 75 mm: "<</PageSize[136 213]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 48x100mm/48 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 48x150mm/48 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[136 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: 48x50mm
*ImageableArea 48x30mm/48 x 30 mm: "0 0 136 85"
*ImageableArea 48x50mm/48 x 50 mm: "0 0 136 142"
*ImageableArea 48x75mm/48 x 75 mm: "0 0 136 213"
*ImageableArea 48x100mm/48 x 100 mm: "0 0 136 283"
*ImageableArea 48x150mm/48 x 150 mm: "0 0 136 425"

*DefaultPaperDimension: 48x50mm
*PaperDimension 48x30mm/48 x 30 mm: "136 85"
*PaperDimension 48x50mm/48 x 50 mm: "136 142"
*PaperDimension 48x75mm/48 x 75 mm: "136 213"
*PaperDimension 48x100mm/48 x 100 mm: "136 283"
*PaperDimension 48x150mm/48 x 150 mm: "136 425"

*MaxMediaWidth: "136"
*MaxMediaHeight: "2835"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*VariablePaperSize: True
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 136 136
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 28 2835
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*% ---- Resolution / raster: 203 dpi, 8-bit gray (the filter does the dithering) ----
*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% ---- Filter options ----
*OpenUI *Density/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Density
*DefaultDensity: Medium
*Density Light/Light: ""
*Density Medium/Medium: ""
*Density Dark/Dark: ""
*CloseUI: *Density

*OpenUI *Dither/Dithering: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 31 AnySetup *Dither
*DefaultDither: FloydSteinberg
*Dither FloydSteinberg/Floyd-Steinberg (photos): ""
*Dither Threshold/Threshold (text, line art): ""
*CloseUI: *Dither

*OpenUI *TrimBlank/Trim Blank Space (end; start of scaled pages): Boolean
*OrderDependency: 32 AnySetup *TrimBlank
*DefaultTrimBlank: True
*TrimBlank True/Yes: ""
*TrimBlank False/No: ""
*CloseUI: *TrimBlank

*OpenUI *Oversize/Pages Wider Than the Paper: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 34 AnySetup *Oversize
*DefaultOversize: FitContent
*Oversize FitContent/Scale printed area to paper width: ""
*Oversize Crop/Crop to the left 48 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *Oversize

*OpenUI *Feed/Paper Feed After Print: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 33 AnySetup *Feed
*DefaultFeed: 48
*Feed 0/None: ""
*Feed 24/Short: ""
*Feed 48/Normal: ""
*Feed 96/Long: ""
*CloseUI: *Feed

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
